package views

// ServicesPage lists what the workshop does. Copy limited to scope the owner
// has confirmed (see docs/notes/owner-call-2026-08-09.md); sublet exhaust,
// gearbox and radiator work is omitted pending confirmation, and the 7-working-day
// turnaround is withheld until the owner clarifies whether it covers routine
// servicing or only major work.
templ ServicesPage(l Layout) {
	@Base(l) {
		<section class="page">
			<h1>What we do</h1>
			<p class="page-lede">
				We are Hino and Hilux specialists working for Gauteng fleet operators.
				We look after the light-duty Hino 300, the medium-duty Hino 500 and
				the heavy-duty Hino 700, along with the Toyota Hilux in D4D 2.5,
				D4D 3.0, GD6 2.4 and GD6 2.8.
			</p>
			<ul class="services">
				<li>
					<h2>Diagnostics &amp; fault-finding</h2>
					<p>We work out what is actually wrong before we replace anything. Guess-work repairs are how a fleet pays twice for the same fault.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h2>Full maintenance, not one-off jobs</h2>
					<p>Preventative maintenance planned around your operating cycle, so vehicles stay working instead of waiting for the next breakdown.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h2>Engine overhauls</h2>
					<p>Done in our own workshop, by people who work on these engines every week.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h2>General mechanical repairs &amp; servicing</h2>
					<p>Routine servicing and mechanical repair work on Hino trucks and Hilux bakkies, in-house.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h2>Breakdown recovery, arranged</h2>
					<p>If a vehicle goes down before 17:00 we call in the breakdown operator we work with to fetch it. If your fleet runs its own recovery, bring it straight to us.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h2>Fleet rates that improve as you grow</h2>
					<p>The more of your fleet we look after, the lower your hourly rate. We would rather maintain your vehicles for years than make money on a single job. Ask us for your fleet rate.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="page-note">
				We work with fleet operators only, from around five vehicles up to
				about a hundred, not private or walk-in customers. We do not do
				panel beating.
			</p>
		</section>
	}
}
